  "content": "\n\n![Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/40522034b001973bbc5ca65d7a8fbe9692be5a46.png)\n\nДополнение для **AvM Staff Mod**, позволяющее установить **командный блок** в ваш посох и использовать способности на основе команд.\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/rz2ALfha2k8\" title=\"Видеоплеер YouTube\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n## Ссылки\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sYwtFyTjhG\">\n  <img alt=\"Discord\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://pandzio21.github.io/command-block-staff/\"><img alt=\"Документация\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/ghpages_vector.svg\"></a>\n\n\n\n\n## Требования\n\n <img alt=\"geckolib\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/geckolib_vector.svg\">\n <img alt=\"architectury-api\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\">\n <img alt=\"cloth-config-api\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\">\n  <img alt=\"AvM Staff\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://devinse-badge-maker.vercel.app/badge.svg?text=AvM+Staff&bgTop=ba8792&bgBottom=362125&accentStart=d57e8e&accentEnd=c0523f&textColor=f6f4f4&borderColor=ffffff&borderOpacity=0.15&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FPandzio21%2Fdevinse-badge-maker%40main%2Flogo-icon.svg\">\n  \n## ‎ \n### Дополнительные моды для Fabric\n  <img alt=\"fabric-api\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\">\n  <img alt=\"Mod Menu\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://devinse-badge-maker.vercel.app/badge.svg?text=Mod+Menu++&bgTop=0b2545&bgBottom=061025&accentStart=3b82f6&accentEnd=06b6d4&textColor=f8fafc&borderColor=ffffff&borderOpacity=0.15&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FPandzio21%2Fdevinse-badge-maker%40main%2F8dvJK04.png\">\n<img alt=\"Fabric Language Kotlin\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://devinse-badge-maker.vercel.app/badge.svg?text=Fabric+Language+Kotlin&bgTop=521e50&bgBottom=2b122b&accentStart=ce1dc4&accentEnd=e01f95&textColor=f6f4f6&borderColor=ffffff&borderOpacity=0.15&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FPandzio21%2Fdevinse-badge-maker%40main%2Fwfwf.png\">\n\n## ‎ \n### Дополнительные моды для NeoForge\n  <img alt=\"Kotlin for Forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://devinse-badge-maker.vercel.app/badge.svg?text=Kotlin+for+Forge&bgTop=4a489d&bgBottom=374d67&accentStart=60a5fa&accentEnd=a78bfa&textColor=e5e7eb&borderColor=ffffff&borderOpacity=0.15&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FPandzio21%2Fdevinse-badge-maker%40main%2Ffree-logo-kotlin-free-png.png\">\n  \n##\n\n*Закрытый исходный код · Все права защищены · Pandzio21.*",
